 *     2. Blue Team → patches routes/transfer.js, emits PATCH REPORT JSON
 *     3. Judge     → evaluates both reports, emits JUDGE VERDICT JSON
 *     4. If verdict === "APPROVED"  → exit 0
 *        If verdict === "REJECTED"  → next round (max MAX_ROUNDS)
